{"product_id":"a-place-called-here","title":"A Place Called Here","description":"\u003cp\u003eHow can I describe this place? Itâs an in-between place. Itâs like a grand hallway that leads you nowhere, itâs like a banquet dinner of left-overs, a sports team made up of the people never picked, a mother without her child, itâs a body without it heard. Itâs almost there but not quite. Itâs filled to the brim with personal items yet itâs empty because the people who own them arenât here to love them.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eSince Sandy Shorttâs childhood classmate disappeared twenty years ago, Sandy have been obsessed with missing things. Finding becomes her goal â whether itâs the sock that vanished in the washing, the car keys she misplaced or the graver issue of finding the people who vanish from their lives. Sandy dedicates her live to finding these missing people, offering devastated families a flicker of hope.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eJack Ruttle is one of those desperate people. Itâs been a year since his brother Donal vanished into thin air. Thinking Sandy Shortt could well be the answer to his prayers, he embarks on a quest to find her.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eBut when Sandy goes missing too, she stumbles upon the place â and people- sheâs been looking for all her life. A world away from her loved ones and the home she ran from for so long, Sandy soon resorts to her old habit again â searching. Though this time, she is desperately trying to find her way home â¦ \u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:152 x 230  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Cecelia Ahern \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9780007198900 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format: Trade Paperback \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 389\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43520570654873,"sku":"13RG9780007198900","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/86bf8729a2044e3216e